/harness/
/dist/
/package.log
/build-full.log

# Credential files must never reach the remote.
#
# /harness/ already hides the upstream checkout, and that is where DEEPSEEK_API_KEY would land
# today. This block exists so the builder root cannot silently gain a .env later: the local
# Harness credential store is $DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml, outside this repository, and nothing
# here should ever become a second copy of it. An API key pushed to a public remote is disclosed
# the moment it is pushed -- history rewriting cannot un-disclose it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
